  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in sq. units) bounded between <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math> and <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math> from <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> to <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi></math> is",
